00:00:29.681 --> 00:00:30.749
Methodology.

00:00:30.749 --> 00:00:38.374
All data on this site was collected from public government sources using automated scrapers that download CSV and JSON exports.

00:00:38.374 --> 00:00:43.443
The data is processed by Python scripts that aggregate, cross-reference, and flag patterns.

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.909
Corrections policy.

00:00:44.909 --> 00:00:51.636
If any statistic, source link, or claim on this site is inaccurate, I will correct it immediately and note the correction.

00:00:51.636 --> 00:00:54.602
The goal of this project is truth, not propaganda.

00:00:54.602 --> 00:00:59.238
If the government's data proves me wrong about something, I will say so publicly.

